      "message": "fix(security): [1.2.x] harden user settings validation, Guest writes, and realtime graph access (#9014)\n\n* Harden user settings validation, Guest write restrictions, and realtime graph access\n\nValidate user preference values against $settings_user field schemas in\nauth_profile.php and save_user_settings(), enforce POST/CSRF on\nauth_profile.php?action=update_data, and reject Guest account mutations\nacross profile and realtime endpoints.\n\nValidate preview and tree graph pagination and column settings before\nbuilding SQL LIMIT clauses or rendering JavaScript configuration values.\n\nEnforce is_graph_allowed() before realtime poller execution and cache\nreads in graph_realtime.php, anchor the graph_nolegend regex, validate\nsess_realtime_hash, and clamp realtime intervals before shell execution.\n\nSigned-off-by: Thomas Vincent <thomasvincent@gmail.com>\n\n* test(security): require lib/html_graph.php directly instead of eval in hardening test\n\nSigned-off-by: Thomas Vincent <thomasvincent@gmail.com>\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Thomas Vincent <thomasvincent@gmail.com>",
